MANGALORE REFINERY AND PETROCHEMICALS LIMITED (MRPL)
STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE: MRPL-SOP-MECH-042
TITLE: CENTRIFUGAL PUMP BEARING MAINTENANCE & SHUTDOWN THRESHOLDS

Page 24 - Section 4.2: Vibration Criteria (ISO 10816 Class II)
1. Vibration < 3.0 mm/s: Satisfactory continuous operation.
2. Vibration 3.0 - 4.5 mm/s: Allowable for short term; monitor weekly.
3. Vibration > 4.5 mm/s: WARNING threshold. Perform oil analysis and prepare standby pump.
4. Vibration > 6.0 mm/s: MANDATORY SHUTDOWN. Immediate changeover to standby unit P-102A required. Complete overhaul of non-drive-end bearing assembly required prior to re-commissioning.